      "message": "The whole transform and tagging concept is a lot of complexity for what ends up being a very simple use case.  Would it be better to replace it with allowing the SdkAware module to participate in the versioning?  Something like:\n\ninterface SdkAware {\n    ...\n    UnversionedToVersioned(ps *bpPropertySet, versionedName func(string) string)\n}",
